      "summary": "At the Baron Investment Conference on 6 Nov 2026, Elon Musk said Tesla will probably rent Optimus humanoid robots. Talk of about $30,000 falling toward $20,000 is build cost, not a rental price. Outside deliveries still point to around end of 2027.",
