      "image": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-model-y-standard-front.jpg",
      "title": "Tesla says it arrives in Argentina on 20 November; exhibition first, sales later",
      "summary": "Tesla confirmed an Argentina arrival date of 20 November 2026 via @Tesla_LatAm, with @Tesla and Elon Musk quoting the post. Argentine press reports an Unicenter exhibition first, with sales and test drives planned for 2027. Official posts name no models or prices.",
      "tag": "Markets",
      "date": "2026-11-06T20:37:00Z",
      "thumb": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-model-y-standard-front-480w.webp"
