      "image": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-model-y-juniper.jpg",
      "title": "The Tesla Model Y is Australia's best-selling passenger car through October, with 39,035 sold against 35,927 RAV4s",
      "summary": "CarsGuide reports the Tesla Model Y sold 39,035 units in Australia from January to October 2026, ahead of the Toyota RAV4's 35,927. Elon called it the best-selling car of any kind on Earth; the figures cover Australian passenger cars only.",
